    phrases: ['what is plaque', 'tartar', 'calculus on teeth', 'ano ang plaque'],
    keys: ['plaque', 'tartar', 'calculus', 'buildup'],
    en: 'Plaque is a soft film of bacteria. It forms every day and comes off with brushing and floss. If it stays, minerals in saliva turn it into tartar, which is hard and needs a clinic cleaning. Tartar near the gumline is a common reason gums bleed. You cannot brush tartar off once it hardens.',
    tl: 'Ang plaque ay malambot na patong ng bacteria. Nabubuo ito araw-araw at natatanggal sa sipilyo at floss. Kapag naiwan, ginagawa itong tartar ng mineral sa laway. Matigas na iyon at kailangan ng cleaning sa clinic. Ang tartar malapit sa gumline ang madalas na dahilan kung bakit dumudugo ang gilagid. Hindi mo na ito masisipilyo kapag tumigas na.',
    chipsEn: ['What is a dental cleaning?', 'Why do my gums bleed?'],
    chipsTl: ['Ano ang dental cleaning?', 'Bakit dumudugo ang gilagid ko?'],
