    keys: ['afraid', 'scared', 'anxiety', 'fear', 'nervous', 'takot', 'kabado'],
    en: 'A lot of people are nervous in the chair. Tell the clinic before the visit. You can ask them to explain each step, and to stop when you raise a hand. A consultation with no treatment is a fair first visit. Bring earphones if that helps. Numbing is used before fillings and removals. You are allowed to ask what will happen next.',
