    keys: ['checkup', 'checkups', 'recall', 'every', 'often', 'kadals'],
    en: 'Most people do well with a checkup and cleaning about every six months. Some gums and some cavity patterns need a shorter gap, and a very steady mouth can go longer. The dentist sets that after seeing you. Do not wait for pain. Cavities and gum disease are quieter at the start. Book the next visit before you leave if you can.',
