    phrases: ['what is a retainer', 'wear my retainer', 'retainer after braces', 'ano ang retainer'],
    keys: ['retainer', 'retainers', 'relapse'],
    en: 'A retainer holds teeth in place after braces or aligners. Teeth can drift without it, especially in the first year. Wear it the way your dentist asked, usually full time at first and nights later. Clean it every day and keep it in the case, not in a napkin. If it cracks or feels tight after you skipped days, call the clinic instead of bending it.',
    tl: 'Hinahawakan ng retainer ang ngipin sa puwesto pagkatapos ng braces o aligners. Puwedeng gumalaw ang ngipin kung wala ito, lalo na sa unang taon. Sundin kung paano sinabi ng dentist, madalas buong araw muna tapos gabi na lang. Linisin ito araw-araw at ilagay sa case, hindi sa napkin. Kung nabasag ito o humigpit pagkatapos mong lumiban ng ilang araw, tawagan ang clinic imbes na baluktutin ito.',
