    en: 'Numbing from a dental visit often lasts one to three hours, sometimes longer for lower teeth. Do not eat hot food or chew while your lip is still numb. You can bite it without noticing. Tingling as it wears off is normal. Call the clinic if a large area is still completely numb the next day, or if you have a rash or trouble breathing after an injection. That last one is urgent.',
    tl: 'Ang pamamanhid pagkatapos ng dental visit ay madalas isang hanggang tatlong oras, minsan mas matagal sa ibabang ngipin. Huwag kumain ng mainit o nguyain habang manhid pa ang labi. Puwede mo itong makagat nang hindi mo namamalayan. Normal ang kiliti habang nawawala ito. Tawagan ang clinic kung malaking parte pa rin ang tuluyang manhid kinabukasan, o kung may rashes o hirap huminga pagkatapos ng injection. Urgent ang huli.',
